suit mafia wanting to know more  clint intervened on kate's behalf and  helped her get away when clint began to  interrogate kate about her use of the  ronin suit he discovered that kate had  been inspired by the events of the  chitauri invasion when she witnessed  hawkeye fighting alongside the other  avengers on an even footing this  convinced kate that you don't need  superpowers to be a hero and she devoted  her life to becoming a master archer  like her idol clint made it clear that  the ronin persona was no joke and kate  revealed to him that she'd found the  ronin costume during a black market  auction held by a mysterious and  powerful criminal clint then warned kate  that ronan had made a lot of dangerous  enemies over the years and that they  would all be coming after her  kate and clint's private moment was  interrupted by the tracksuit mafia's  assault on their hiding place the duo  managed to escape but clint felt  hampered by the lack of his usual  arsenal along with his worry for kate  and his desire to get back to his family  meanwhile the ronin suit had once again  disappeared but clint discovered that it  was in the possession of a group of  live-action role players he also found  out that kate came from a powerful  family with a sketchy background despite  her wanting to work alongside him clint  opted to complete the rest of his  mission on his own and sent kate back to  her family after assuring his wife that  he would be home soon clint set out to  hunt down the ronin costume alone  unfortunately clint was still being  followed by the tracksuit mafia who were  initially recruited to get their hands  on a special rolex watch that belonged  to his wife it would come to learn that  the villains were acting on behalf of a  woman named maya lopez aka ekko who held  a personal grudge against clint for  killing her father during his time as  ronan  clint said about uncovering the true  nature of the tracksuit mafia's attack  on him and kate and determined that the  mafia was actually being run by the  powerful wilson fisk aka kingpin bisk  didn't want to get involved in a fight  with an avenger but maya's personal  vendetta was all that mattered to her  clan also found himself bonding with  kate and warming up to her enthusiastic  views on hawkeye from wanting clint to  improve his brand to coming up with new  trick arrows kate even took glenn home  to meet her family but her mother  eleanor became concerned that her  daughter was getting mixed up in  dangerous circles i mean she's pretty  good at all this guy natasha romanoff  was pretty damn good at wasn't she while  trying to get the drop on the tracksuit  mafia clint was ambushed by an assassin  who turned out to be elena bolova who  held clint responsible for the death of  her sister natasha by trying to end  things with the tracksuit mafia and  investigating the true nature of the  company run by kate's parents elaine  proved to be another major obstacle that  forced glenn to rely on kate's help once  again with his enemies closing in around  him clint revealed to maya that wilson  fisk had orchestrated events so that  ronin would kill her father because fisk  saw maya's dad as a threat the savvy  villain had used ronin to get rid of his  competition manipulating the situation  to his benefit clint also finally had it  out with elena telling her the truth  about natasha's death and spoke about  how devastated he was over the loss of  his friend at long last elena believed  clint's story and the two grieved over  the death of natasha together meanwhile  kate discovered that her mother eleanor  was secretly working with kingpin to pay  off an old debt after a narrow escape  kate was able to take down fisk and  regretfully handed her mother over to  the authorities with the whole affair  finally put to rest clint asked kate to  spend christmas at the farm with his  family he returned the rolex to his wife  and suggested to his new protege that  they should share the name hawkeye going  forward  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  your favorite marvel superheroes are  coming soon subscribe to our youtube  channel and hit the bell so you don't  miss a single one  you
 

